{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Calix</strong> is a fast-paced platformer where you die in just one hit, but can also defeat most enemies with a single strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_01.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Viola</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viola has a fast and deadly combat style, capable of throwing daggers at enemies and marking those who survive to teleport to them and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/SteamPage_GIFTeste.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gilda</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gilda has two energy charges that can be used to create an explosion or throw a spear that travels across the entire stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_03.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a wide variety of enemies, and if you want, activate <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode to make the journey even more challenging, adding new enemies that transcend reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_06.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each chapter, face a unique boss that will test your perseverance. These bosses can also become even more challenging with <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_05.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608620?t=1745452822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608620?t=1745452822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/1ea2ac59fb115a37816d6af53ecbda63d38e22b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745452822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/1ea2ac59fb115a37816d6af53ecbda63d38e22b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745452822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game tackles sensitive topics such as suicide."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Calix</strong> is a fast-paced platformer where you die in just one hit, but can also defeat most enemies with a single strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_01.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Viola</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viola has a fast and deadly combat style, capable of throwing daggers at enemies and marking those who survive to teleport to them and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/SteamPage_GIFTeste.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gilda</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gilda has two energy charges that can be used to create an explosion or throw a spear that travels across the entire stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_03.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a wide variety of enemies, and if you want, activate <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode to make the journey even more challenging, adding new enemies that transcend reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_06.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each chapter, face a unique boss that will test your perseverance. These bosses can also become even more challenging with <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/Description_Art_05.png?t=1745452822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["UnderLight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/5165627bf9b998b8b060ec7e6efcd0610f3cd2d1/header.jpg?t=1745452822","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Calix","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3 10100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3 10100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory